{"id":"64be5bb144292d4e","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-constructor-trs.md","title":"构造子重写系统","display":"df-constructor-trs — 构造子重写系统","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-constructor-trs","aliases":["56-df-constructor-trs"],"display":"df-constructor-trs — 构造子重写系统","depends_on":["[[56-df-rewrite-system]]","[[56-df-terms]]","[[56-df-subterm]]"],"source_reference":"Terese (2003), §3.4.2, printed p76","source_ocr_block":"97","source_status":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-constructor-trs"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-constructor-trs</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-constructor-trs — 构造子重写系统"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" href=\"?note=a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-system\">56-df-rewrite-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5e02461ce48023cc\" href=\"?note=5e02461ce48023cc\" title=\"56-df-terms\">56-df-terms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c3157a722a0edf96\" href=\"?note=c3157a722a0edf96\" title=\"56-df-subterm\">56-df-subterm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), §3.4.2, printed p76"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"97"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\\)</span>、变量集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 与规则集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>。给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,C\\subseteq F\">\\(D,C\\subseteq F\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subterms}\">\\(\\mathrm{Subterms}\\)</span> 与非变量项的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{root}\">\\(\\mathrm{root}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c3157a722a0edf96\" href=\"?note=c3157a722a0edf96\" title=\"56-df-subterm\">56-df-subterm</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_C\">\\(T_C\\)</span> 是下式明确构造的构造子项子集，允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=\\varnothing\">\\(C=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_C\\coloneqq\\{t\\in T:\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Subterms}(t)\\;(u\\notin V\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{root}(u)\\in C)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_C\\coloneqq\\{t\\in T:\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Subterms}(t)\\;(u\\notin V\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{root}(u)\\in C)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConstructorTRS}(\\Sigma,V,R,D,C)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\land F=D\\cup C\\land D\\cap C=\\varnothing\\land\\forall(l,r)\\in R\\;\\exists f\\in D\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in T_C^n\\;(n=\\mathrm{ar}(f)\\land l=f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ConstructorTRS}(\\Sigma,V,R,D,C)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\land F=D\\cup C\\land D\\cap C=\\varnothing\\land\\forall(l,r)\\in R\\;\\exists f\\in D\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in T_C^n\\;(n=\\mathrm{ar}(f)\\land l=f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §3.4.2（印刷 p76，OCR 页块97）。左部的根为已定义符号，全部参数只由构造子和变量组成；不能仅用“根为已定义符号”替代此限制。CL 不是这种格式，因为 Ap 在左部参数中再次出现。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-rewrite-system","status":"resolved","id":"a6c29a8d098ef0ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-terms","status":"resolved","id":"5e02461ce48023cc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-subterm","status":"resolved","id":"c3157a722a0edf96","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-subterm]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-subterm","status":"resolved","id":"c3157a722a0edf96","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})$、变量集 $V$ 与规则集 $R$。给定 $D,C\\subseteq F$；$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$，$\\mathrm{Subterms}$ 与非变量项的 $\\mathrm{root}$ 见 [[56-df-subterm]]。$T_C$ 是下式明确构造的构造子项子集，允许 $C=\\varnothing$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"D,C\\subseteq F","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Subterms}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{root}","display":false},{"tex":"T_C","display":false},{"tex":"C=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"T_C\\coloneqq\\{t\\in T:\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Subterms}(t)\\;(u\\notin V\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{root}(u)\\in C)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConstructorTRS}(\\Sigma,V,R,D,C)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\land F=D\\cup C\\land D\\cap C=\\varnothing\\land\\forall(l,r)\\in R\\;\\exists f\\in D\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in T_C^n\\;(n=\\mathrm{ar}(f)\\land l=f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)).","display":true}],"bytes":1438,"backlinks":[{"id":"d754a1c4c76d6038","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-263","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-constructor-trs.md]]"}],"outgoing":["a6c29a8d098ef0ed","5e02461ce48023cc","c3157a722a0edf96"]}